  "description": "The Ahura.Extensions.Translation.Sql library provides SQL-based implementations for the translation and localization services defined in Ahura.Extensions.Translation.Abstraction. This library enables storing, retrieving, and managing multilingual data directly from a SQL database, allowing applications to dynamically load translations and localizations at runtime. It is optimized for performance, ensuring efficient access to indexed multilingual data.",
